{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701190/extras/8484799b873ced7d831531e68352a311.avif?t=1774375952\" width=650 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701190/extras/72b77440b5aeef2816fa4a028e6a3e9d.poster.avif?t=1774375952\" width=700 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701190/extras/72b77440b5aeef2816fa4a028e6a3e9d.webm?t=1774375952\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701190/extras/72b77440b5aeef2816fa4a028e6a3e9d.mp4?t=1774375952\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a living mushroom bound to the ancient mycelium, defending the forest\u2019s balance against spreading corruption. Face endless waves of twisted insects in a dark-fantasy bullet-hell survivors-like. Team up online, share progress, and combine powers to stand against the swarm together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701190/extras/9a31cbdd0d24aafb00ae215cddddf92d.avif?t=1774375952\" width=650 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701190/extras/49f5e4da37538cc287b23d51482dba9e.poster.avif?t=1774375952\" width=700 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701190/extras/49f5e4da37538cc287b23d51482dba9e.webm?t=1774375952\" type=\"video/w